---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="CV"
  description="Academic CV of Radin Khayyam, MSc student in artificial intelligence at Koç University and BSc graduate in electrical engineering from Sharif."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>CV</h1>
    <p class="lede">The academic CV, as a PDF.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="block">
    <p>
      I studied electrical engineering at Sharif University of Technology, with a GPA of 18.08/20, and in October 2026 I
      started an MSc in artificial intelligence at Koç University on the Presidential Fellowship. The primary research
      is learning theory, with Prof. Zafer Doğan in the MLIP group. The second track is applications of AI, in
      biomedical signals and in recommender systems and personalized AI, including the work at Solico Group.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href={site.cvPath} download>Download the CV</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
